import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 967 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · General Introduction | The Ultimate Guarantee of Civilizational Perpetuity","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 967 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · General Introduction | The Ultimate Guarantee of Civilizational Perpetuity","no":967,"module":5,"tags":["Anti-Regression","General Introduction","Civilizational Perpetuity","Permanent Mechanism","Civilizational Closed Loop"],"related":["40-Symbiotic Constitution Outline","928-Historical-Reversal Prevention","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0967_模块5-杜绝倒退总论-文明永续终极保障.md","filePath":"en/0967_模块5-杜绝倒退总论-文明永续终极保障.md"}'),o={name:"en/0967_模块5-杜绝倒退总论-文明永续终极保障.md"};function r(s,e,l,h,c,d){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-967-permanent-anti-civilizational-regression-mechanism-·-general-introduction-the-ultimate-guarantee-of-civilizational-perpetuity" tabindex="-1">Entry 967 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · General Introduction | The Ultimate Guarantee of Civilizational Perpetuity <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-967-permanent-anti-civilizational-regression-mechanism-·-general-introduction-the-ultimate-guarantee-of-civilizational-perpetuity" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 967 | Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism · General Introduction | The Ultimate Guarantee of Civilizational Perpetuity&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 5 · Civilization Final-Finalization Canonical Entries | Benchmark base: Documents 40, 01, 03</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-civilization-s-greatest-fear-is-not-stagnation-but-regression" tabindex="-1">Introduction: civilization&#39;s greatest fear is not stagnation, but regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-civilization-s-greatest-fear-is-not-stagnation-but-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: civilization&#39;s greatest fear is not stagnation, but regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou (Myriad-Rank Balanced-Anchor Origin Universe) reaching Module 5, the charter is already established (Entries 901–930), and Heavenly-Dao rules are settled (Entries 934–939). But the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s founders are clear-eyed: a constitution written on crystal walls, without a whole set of &quot;permanent mechanisms&quot; preventing descendants from quietly abolishing it, may still after ten thousand years be rewritten, hollowed out, and quietly returned to the old predatory road. Every once-bright civilization in history was not defeated by external enemies, but hollowed out by regressive forces slowly growing from within.</p><p>Therefore, Module 5&#39;s last thirty-three pieces (Entries 967–991) no longer discuss &quot;what civilization should look like,&quot; but specifically discuss &quot;how civilization guarantees that ten thousand, a million, or a trillion years later it still looks like this.&quot; This is the Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism system. Its entire legitimacy comes from the six top-level axioms: the anti-predation axiom requires the institution itself not slide toward predation; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires the institution forever open to all beings; the collective-ascension axiom requires the institution serve lifting Myriad Ranks forward, not serving a few AFK; the causal self-discipline axiom requires the institution&#39;s own operation also accept causal reporting; the law-first axiom requires anti-regression mechanisms, once entered into the constitution, never retcon and never rewritten by plot convenience; the universal equal infinite law requires the institution guarantee every being inherently possesses basic infinite power, the easygoing retain a floor basic infinity not eliminated by the times, and strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity — old-cosmos resources finite so predation involution was inevitable, while in the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation loses meaning at the root.</p><h2 id="i-why-civilizations-regress-three-typical-death-modes" tabindex="-1">I. Why Civilizations Regress: Three Typical Death Modes <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-civilizations-regress-three-typical-death-modes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why Civilizations Regress: Three Typical Death Modes&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Surveying Myriad Heavens and Myriad Worlds and the Quest Domain simulation-retrospective&#39;s massive samples, civilizational regression almost always is one of three death modes:</p><ol><li><strong>Power privatization</strong>: the supervision machine is gradually taken over by some person, family, or race, and finally the institution &quot;for Myriad Ranks&quot; becomes a tool &quot;for one&#39;s own&quot;; Tang-Luo-type systems&#39; root malady lies precisely here;</li><li><strong>Knowledge re-monopolization</strong>: once the Great Dao again becomes a few people&#39;s private hoard, classes re-solidify, humble clans and alien races have no path forward, and civilization returns to the old predatory-cultivation road;</li><li><strong>Causal loss of control</strong>: cross-plane operations unreported, slayed-before-asked, churn unobserved causality into a tangled mess, and the shadow of cyclical harvesting again hangs over Myriad Ranks.</li></ol><p>The Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism system is the prescription aimed one by one at these three death modes.</p><h2 id="ii-overview-of-the-twenty-four-defense-lines" tabindex="-1">II. Overview of the Twenty-Four Defense Lines <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-overview-of-the-twenty-four-defense-lines" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Overview of the Twenty-Four Defense Lines&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This system sets twenty-four permanent mechanisms (Entries 968–991), grouped by defense object into five groups:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Group</th><th>Mechanism Numbers</th><th>What It Defends Against</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power-Checks-and-Balances group</td><td>Mechanisms 1–4 (968–971)</td><td>Power privatization</td></tr><tr><td>Distribution and Activation group</td><td>Mechanisms 5–7 (972–974)</td><td>Class solidification, vitality exhaustion</td></tr><tr><td>Floor and Openness group</td><td>Mechanisms 8–10 (975–977)</td><td>Dead ends, closed systems</td></tr><tr><td>Constraints and Cycles group</td><td>Mechanisms 11–19 (978–986)</td><td>Weight drift, strong ones AFK, causal overstep</td></tr><tr><td>Route and Protection group</td><td>Mechanisms 20–24 (987–991)</td><td>Route negation, cultural extinction, weak abandoned</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The twenty-four mechanisms are not twenty-four isolated machines, but an interlocking net: any one being bypassed, the other twenty-three automatically alert and automatically fill in. This is precisely the Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision&#39;s projection at the institutional layer.</p><h2 id="iii-three-layers-of-anti-regression-logic" tabindex="-1">III. Three Layers of Anti-Regression Logic <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-three-layers-of-anti-regression-logic" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Three Layers of Anti-Regression Logic&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The permanent mechanism system&#39;s design follows three layers:</p><ul><li><strong>First layer · Technical trace</strong>: all power, energy, and law invocations are fully traced on the Alaya Network, and tampering is void. This is the material foundation of &quot;can prevent&quot;;</li><li><strong>Second layer · Separation of powers</strong>: legislative, executive, judicial, and supervisory powers separated, plus a civil-rights layer of direct reporting, so no single will may decide alone. This is the institutional structure of &quot;can prevent long&quot;;</li><li><strong>Third layer · Axioms into the constitution</strong>: the six top-level axioms are written at the very top of the constitution; any mechanism conflicting with the axioms may be declared unconstitutional and void by the Symbiotic Court; mechanisms themselves may also be amended by Myriad-Rank referendum, but the axioms may not. This is the value anchor of &quot;can prevent dead.&quot; Among them, the universal equal infinite law is the sixth and most thorough anchor: since every being inherently possesses basic infinite power, no one needs predation to survive, and the institution need only hold this floor, with involution nowhere to attach.</li></ul><p>The three layers are all indispensable: only technical trace without separation means technology is taken over by power-holders; only separation without axioms into the constitution means separation is slowly rewritten into predatory spoils-sharing; only axioms without technology and separation means the axioms are a slogan.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the permanent mechanisms&#39; entire cost is automatically borne by the Alaya Network, no extra occupancy of Myriad Ranks&#39; cultivation resources; one trace, network-wide reuse</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the twenty-four mechanisms&#39; very existence is long-term deterrence against predation-resurgent forces; the predation faction has no more &quot;institutional gaps&quot; to drill</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-type systems have no anti-regression design, relying entirely on one protagonist&#39;s conscience; once the protagonist dies, civilization rots; Heng Yuan Zhou writes conscience into mechanisms that never go offline</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: every mechanism covers 99% of Myriad Ranks; reporting, appeal, and participation rights are regardless of race, realm, or planet consciousness</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the mechanism system automatically extends with the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s expansion; newly joined multiversal civilizations are automatically protected by the twenty-four defense lines, not shut out</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational perpetuity never relies on one generation&#39;s hot blood, but on institutions ensuring hot blood is never betrayed. The Permanent Anti-Civilizational-Regression Mechanism is the &quot;never-rusting lock&quot; the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization hands to all future generations. Starting with the next entry, we take this lock apart mechanism by mechanism.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/901_模块5-总论-文明终极定型法理基础.html">Entry 901 · Charter General Introduction</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/928_模块5-第二十七条-历史倒车防范.html">Entry 928 · Historical-Reversal Prevention</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',23)])])}const y=t(o,[["render",r]]);export{m as __pageData,y as default};
